{"id":"422262","name":"萝卜排骨汤","author":"木木夕酉星","authorId":"11048563","desc":"","cover":"images/422262/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"2根"},{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"1段"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材如图。","img":"images/422262/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"排骨放入冷水锅中焯水。","img":"images/422262/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"生姜大葱拍破。","img":"images/422262/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"萝卜削皮切块。","img":"images/422262/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"排骨焯水至水沸。","img":"images/422262/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出排骨用温水冲干净浮末，沥水备用。","img":"images/422262/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"排骨生姜大葱放砂锅里。","img":"images/422262/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"注入适量的清水，然后盖上盖子大火烧开，转小火炖一个小时。","img":"images/422262/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入白萝卜翻几下，继续盖上盖子炖四十分钟。","img":"images/422262/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放少许盐。","img":"images/422262/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻均匀即可。","img":"images/422262/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅装碗。","img":"images/422262/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"撒上葱花。","img":"images/422262/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}